22. LEARNING SUMMARY
--------------------
If you understand Order History, you should understand this chain:

useState
   ↓
Array of objects
   ↓
setState callback
   ↓
useEffect
   ↓
JSON.stringify / JSON.parse
   ↓
localStorage
   ↓
map()
   ↓
Conditional rendering

